# 0.1 (`HEADER-GENRE-REQUIREMENT`): the header must be the FIRST SIGNIFICANT line —
# comments and blank lines MAY precede it. A provenance block above the
# header is common in production corpora, and the grammar admits it.
# source: hand-written
# method: transcribed from an ASCII figure

figdown 0.1 block
title "Provenance block above the header"
node a "A"
